%% The live read → correct → rebroadcast spine, and the control surface.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant M as Power meter
    participant C as BleMeterClient<br/>(central)
    participant P as ProxyCore + Correction
    participant K as BleCrankPeripheral<br/>(peripheral)
    participant S as SB20 bike
    participant U as Phone / Garmin

    Note over M,S: Live loop (~1–4 Hz)
    M->>C: CPS measurement (power, crank revs)
    C->>P: PowerReading (raw watts)
    P->>P: apply correction (curve wins, else scale/offset)
    P->>K: corrected watts + crank passthrough
    K->>S: Stages 0x2F frame (as its own crank)
    K->>U: CPS notify / status

    Note over S,U: Calibrate / control (on demand)
    S->>K: Control Point 0x10 (enhanced offset)
    K-->>S: reply with Stages company id 442 + mfg data
    U->>K: config write (spoof/corrector, curve, source)
    K-->>U: read-back (persisted to NVS/LittleFS)
